WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.702
-Former President Donald Trump

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:05.104
recently called in
to a Christian talk show

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:06.172
and said this --

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.874 line:0%
-So nobody has done more

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:11.043 line:0%
for Christianity
or for evangelicals

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:13.313 line:0%
or for religion itself

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:14.581 line:0%
than I have.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:17.650
[ Laughter ]
-Here to talk about it is one

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.151
of our writers, Amber Ruffin.

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:22.855
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:23.990
-Hi!

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.892
Hi, Seth!

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.026
-Hey, Amber.

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:28.761
So, what do you think
about Trump saying

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:31.530
he's done more for religion
than anyone else?

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:33.099
-I think he's correct.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.734
[ Laughter ]
-You don't

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.068
disagree with that statement?

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:37.369
-Why should I?

00:00:37.369 --> 00:00:38.538
It's true.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:39.939
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.874
-It is?
-It is.

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:43.910
-But how is that possible?

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.845
What has he done?

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:48.414
-What has Trump done
for religion?

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:49.949
[ Chuckle ]
Well...

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:50.950
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.385
He did this.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.053
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:55.655
He did that.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:57.456
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:00:57.456 --> 00:01:00.059
He did this and this and this.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:02.061
Don't you forget about that.

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:04.363
[ Laughter and applause ]
♪♪

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:06.032
-But those are all bad things.

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:09.234
-He didn't say he's done
good things for religion.

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:11.805
[ Laughter ]
He just said he did more
for religion

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:13.906
than anyone else
while he was president.

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:15.141
And he's right!

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:18.411
No president has done more
for religion.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:20.346
More bad stuff, that is.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:21.981
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:23.583
Why, he said this.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.685
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:27.253
He did that.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:28.955
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:31.491
He did this and this and this.

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:33.326
Don't you forget about that.

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.128
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:37.930
-Wow.
That is a lot.

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.399
-It sure is, Seth.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:40.800
-Do you have more?

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.934
-Me?!

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.102
[ Laughter ]
More?!

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:45.204
What do you think?

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:47.639
He also said this and this

00:01:47.639 --> 00:01:49.075
[ Laughter ]
and this and this.

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:50.075
And this.

00:01:50.075 --> 00:01:51.643
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

00:01:51.643 --> 00:01:53.345
You know he did this.

00:01:53.345 --> 00:01:54.680
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.716
But it was more like this.

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:59.985
[ Laughter and ohs ]
♪♪

00:01:59.985 --> 00:02:01.053
♪ And... ♪

00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:03.722
♪ Thi-i-i-i-i-i-i-i-i... ♪

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:07.694
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪ ...i-i-i-i-i-i-i... ♪

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:10.262
♪ ...i-i-i-i-i-i-i-i... ♪

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:12.532
♪ ...i-i-i-i-i-i-s ♪

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:13.967
♪♪

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:15.001
-Wow!

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.068
That's a lot.

00:02:16.068 --> 00:02:17.336
♪♪

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:20.306
[ Laughter ]
So, are you, um, done?

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:22.041
♪♪

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.343
[ Laughter and applause ]
Okay.

00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:25.979
-He did this.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.346
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:28.982
He even did that.

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.984
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.452
He did this.

00:02:32.452 --> 00:02:33.619
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:02:33.619 --> 00:02:35.721
