00:02:35.721 --> 00:02:38.023
♪♪

00:02:38.023 --> 00:02:41.193
[ Laughter and applause ]
♪♪

00:02:41.193 --> 00:02:51.203
♪♪

00:02:51.203 --> 00:02:58.877
♪♪

00:02:58.877 --> 00:03:01.814
[ Laughter and applause ]
♪♪

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:03.916
♪♪

00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:08.354
